WEBVTT

00:00:00.557 --> 00:00:01.150
Hello!

00:00:01.266 --> 00:00:05.909
On VaraaAi, each staff member has their own calendar, their own services,

00:00:05.859 --> 00:00:07.230
and their own access.

00:00:07.579 --> 00:00:10.030
Customers can pick the person they know when they book.

00:00:10.457 --> 00:00:14.830
In this lesson, I'll show you how to add staff, and set what each person can see.

00:00:15.459 --> 00:00:18.606
Tap Staff in the menu, then tap Add staff.

00:00:18.839 --> 00:00:23.270
Under Profile, upload a photo, and enter the Staff name, their Title,

00:00:23.220 --> 00:00:24.286
and a short Bio.

00:00:24.879 --> 00:00:28.762
Under Services they perform, tap the services this person can do.

00:00:29.112 --> 00:00:31.802
Customers can only book them for those services.

00:00:32.401 --> 00:00:34.373
Next, Login and access.

00:00:34.595 --> 00:00:37.725
If you want a staff member to sign in and see their own schedule,

00:00:37.675 --> 00:00:39.573
enter an email and a password for them.

00:00:39.830 --> 00:00:41.013
Then pick a quick role:

00:00:41.215 --> 00:00:43.413
Stylist sees only their own bookings.

00:00:43.680 --> 00:00:47.413
Reception sees the whole calendar, customers and contact details.

00:00:47.669 --> 00:00:48.933
Manager sees everything.

00:00:49.273 --> 00:00:53.413
You can also switch each section on or off, under Can view these sections.

00:00:54.015 --> 00:00:54.940
Tap Save.

00:00:55.198 --> 00:00:57.295
The new staff member appears in the list,

00:00:57.245 --> 00:01:00.140
with their bookings and revenue for the last thirty days.

00:01:00.409 --> 00:01:03.215
For each person, tap Edit to change their details,

00:01:03.165 --> 00:01:05.420
Schedule to set their own working hours,

00:01:05.590 --> 00:01:07.580
or Remove when they no longer work with you.

00:01:07.838 --> 00:01:09.260
Now take the quiz below.
